{"route":"/hop/wiki/perks/royal_flush","title":"Royal Train - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Royal Train (Rare perk) in House of Pips: A scoring play with the 6-6 bone adds 30 points.","html":"<p class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks\">Perks</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks#rare\">Rare</a></p>\n<article class=\"entry rarity-rare\" id=\"perk-royal_flush\">\n<header class=\"entry-head\">\n<img class=\"entry-icon\" src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/royal_flush-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\">\n<div><h1>Royal Train</h1><p class=\"entry-sub\">Rare perk &middot; Scoring bonus</p></div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-body\">\n<div class=\"entry-main\">\n<blockquote class=\"card-text\"><p>A scoring play with the 6-6 bone adds 30 points.</p><footer>In-game card text</footer></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<p>A scoring play made <strong>with the 6-6</strong> gains <strong>+30 points for each copy</strong>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"at-a-glance\">At a glance</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"facts\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Rarity</th><td><span class=\"pill rarity-rare\">Rare</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Type</th><td>Scoring bonus</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Needs a scoring play</th><td>Yes. It only fires when the open-end total is a positive multiple of 5.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">How to get it</th><td>Unlock it in the Perks compendium for 600 Bone Bucks once you own 5 Uncommon perks.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"entry-card\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/royal_flush-card.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/royal_flush-card.png\" alt=\"The Royal Train card as drawn in the game\" width=\"468\" height=\"498\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The card as it appears in a draft.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</article>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Neighbouring perks\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/collector\">&larr; Collector</a><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/domino_effect\">Domino Effect &rarr;</a></nav>","toc":[]}